{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-111","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：截差无理线段与二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"The apotome is not the same with the binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":111,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":111,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","contentId":"euclid-10-111","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eca3ac513cedf4712e3dd8bbb0b83df3cb278eb057a277f1cede2bec0c823a85","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-111.statement","euclid-10-111.construction.1","euclid-10-111.proof.1","euclid-10-111.proof.2","euclid-10-111.construction.2","euclid-10-111.proof.3","euclid-10-111.construction.3","euclid-10-111.proof.4","euclid-10-111.proof.5","euclid-10-111.proof.6","euclid-10-111.proof.7","euclid-10-111.conclusion","euclid-10-111.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-111.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6bb96f1ac5a3189a0ee7bbd7458c9761c3d74441a78c5b220ac3bc1c6c33f472","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The apotome is not the same with the binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"截差无理线段和二项无理线段直线不一样"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ccc0be4c5cf46b26d515bf72755f3ed196173afcdaeed4f62f85abe7e3c3a9a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be an apotome; I say that AB is not the same with the binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让我们把AB变成截差无理线段;我说,二项无理线段直线与AB不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"699a438c0e353293499871dadcafc165287f32a083c2fad761d31aedb8b80aa9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be so; let a rational straight line DC be set out, and to CD let there be applied the rectangle CE equal to the square on AB and producing DE as breadth."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,请这样;请列出有理线段 DC,CD,CD,CD,CD,CE,CE,AB,DE,宽度扩大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ed64357fdd7909b481d251b11b7146eaed94fa11c2943294115dad147f838e0","citations":["euclid-10-97"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AB is an apotome, DE is a first apotome. [[X. 97](/principles/euclid-10-97)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是截差无理线段,DE是截差无理线段 [[X. 97](/principles/euclid-10-97)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4932a8350f233e34c41ca714ce82c98f8b4043ac86e7ba454532398f422b4be","citations":["euclid-10-def-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let EF be the annex to it; therefore DF, FE are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, the square on DF is greater than the square on FE by the square on a straight line commensurable with DF, and DF is commensurable in length with the rational straight line DC set out. [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF是附件;因此,DF、FE是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度,DF的正方形比正方形比FE的可公度线正方形大于DF,DF比长度可公度。（相关点与线段：DC） [[X. Deff. III. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd3b5cce5a879727f64f043d1c9edf0f09c030684bed9faca17c890fa0adf455","citations":["euclid-10-60"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AB is binomial, therefore DE is a first binomial straight line. [[X. 60](/principles/euclid-10-60)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB是二项无理线段,DE是第1 二项无理线段直线。 [[X. 60](/principles/euclid-10-60)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":6,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"403205c7afc845344b22484cf1bf6949bfbf791118de8c482537653f911e6650","citations":["euclid-10-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be divided into its terms at G, and let DG be the greater term; therefore DG, GE are rational straight lines commensurable in square only, the square on DG is greater than the square on GE by the square on a straight line commensurable with DG, and the greater term DG is commensurable in length with the rational straight line DC set out. [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它在G时分为DG条款,数量较大的为DG;因此,DGGE有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度个,DG正方形个比GE正方形个正方形个可公度个DG直线多,数量较大的DG长度可公度个有理线段 DC。 [[X. Deff. II. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4985881731847bc3e7060beb7f483c18d6a7d54b8356a34420db33859676c8d","citations":["euclid-10-12","euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DF is also commensurable in length with DG; [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] therefore the remainder GF is also commensurable in length with DF. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DF也是长度可公度,DG;因此,其余GF也是长度可公度,DF。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)] [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39a4db280c540722b1ec90daa3b2bf9b73185bf479f6c7d719cfc8964ef7d357","citations":["euclid-10-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But DF is incommensurable in length with EF; therefore FG is also incommensurable in length with EF. [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但DF长度为不可公度,EF长度为DF;因此,FG长度为不可公度,EF长度为EF。 [[X. 13](/principles/euclid-10-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc04750486475f9cb50cb3956d3d65bfb960843192831613279d6985d8d504ef","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore GF, FE are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EG is an apotome. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GF,FE是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;EG是截差无理线段。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9f137ff60f38014a0b4b6bdbf8227d0656a0d138febecd471a20cd7cafec5dbd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also rational: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也是有理: 这是不可能的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c9f4dd32ccdc5613c39c95fbe42c53e67ead6774074babb49fcf3268d89c168","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the apotome is not the same with the binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,截差无理线段与二项无理线段直线不同,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-111.source","contentId":"euclid-10-111","revisionId":"euclid-10-111@raw-eca3ac513cedf471","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16d05b4c99b6a91314dd67f6d5948362fb5e5e5dc1b53cec44ba08e59ae62400","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-111:euclid-10-97:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-111","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-111.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-97","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111/","sourceLabel":"X. 97"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-111:euclid-10-def-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-111","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-111.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111/","sourceLabel":"X. Deff. III. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-111:euclid-10-60:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-111","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-111.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-60","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.111","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:gr